# Test: `ze cli -c` against a daemon that runs and refuses the login reports
#       the refused login, and never answers from a command's offline
#       fallback as if no daemon ran.
# VALIDATES: dialDaemon (internal/component/cli/sshclient/answer.go) types a
#   login failure after an accepted host key as LoginRefused, and endFailedAsk
#   (internal/component/cli/client/main.go) prints LoginRefusal for it before
#   it would consult runOfflineFallback.
# PREVENTS: `show host trend` printing "show host trend needs the daemon, and
#   no daemon answered" while a daemon answers on that port and refused the
#   stored credentials, which sends the operator to `ze start`.
# Why not a unit test: the unit test proves the dial is typed; only the real
#   client against the real daemon's SSH server proves the operator meets the
#   refusal, through the command that has an offline fallback.
#
# The daemon's configuration declares admin with the password "testpass"; the
# client's environment carries another password, so the daemon refuses it.
# show host trend has an offline fallback (internal/plugins/host/register.go),
# so before the fix this command took it.
#
# The daemon setup is test/plugin/host-trend-show.ci's.

option=needs-linux
option=timeout:value=60s
option=env:var=ze.ssh.username:value=admin
option=env:var=ze.ssh.password:value=not-the-password
option=env:var=ze.ssh.port:value=$PORT
tmpfs=running.conf:terminator=EOF_CONF
system {
	authentication {
		# bcrypt cost-4 hash of "testpass".
		user admin {
			password "$2a$04$UlwuiuH82Unfsq.XEMPGJeDkXwbm3KW.nvVaVXOd/JeFK8VjMjrQO"
		}
	}
}
environment {
	ssh {
		enabled true
		server main {
			ip 127.0.0.1;
			port $PORT;
		}
	}
}
EOF_CONF

# "Ze running." is printed after the SSH listener accepts.
cmd=background:seq=1:exec=ze start running.conf:name=daemon:ready=Ze running.

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze cli -c "show host trend":exit=1
expect=stderr:contains=refused the login of admin
expect=stderr:contains=fix: ze cli --user <name>
reject=stdout:contains=no daemon answered
reject=stdout:contains=fix: ze start
